flowchart TD
    U[Pet owner] --> UI[Streamlit interface: app.py]
    UI --> INPUT[Enter pets, tasks, priorities and daily time budget]
    INPUT --> DATA[In-memory Owner, Pet and Task records: pawpal_system.py]
    UI -->|Generate validated AI care plan| VALIDATE[Validate planning date, time window and budget]
    VALIDATE -->|Invalid| ERROR[Display validation error; no plan applied]
    VALIDATE -->|Valid| PLAN[Rule-based planner: ai_planner.py]
    DATA --> PLAN
    PLAN --> FIXED[Reserve fixed-time tasks; flag conflicting or out-of-window appointments]
    FIXED --> FLEX[Assign flexible tasks to available slots within remaining budget]
    FLEX --> OMIT[Record unscheduled tasks, adjustments and decisions]
    OMIT --> CHECK[Independent evaluation: reliability.py]
    CHECK -->|Pass| DISPLAY[Show proposed times, validation status, unresolved tasks and decision log]
    CHECK -->|Fail| REJECT[Discard invalid proposal and flag evaluator issues]
    REJECT --> DISPLAY
    DISPLAY --> UI
    UI --> REVIEW[Owner reviews suggestions and manually edits tasks if desired]
    REVIEW -.->|Manual edits only| DATA
    TEST[Pytest: 23 passing tests, including 8 planner tests] -.-> PLAN
    TEST -.-> CHECK
    TEST -.-> DATA
